# chemthistry
===
 ChemThisTry is a cross-platform scientific graphics workstation unifying data plotting, chemical structure drawing, 3D molecular visualization, and figure compositing — a lightweight alternative to Origin + ChemDraw + VESTA + Illustrator. Built with Electron + React + TypeScript.
